# REST API

### Get All Profiles
### curl http://localhost:3000/profile
GET http://localhost:3000/profile

### Create New Profile
### curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/profile
POST http://localhost:3000/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "demo12",
    "password": "1234",
    "mobile": "09999999994",
    "cardId": "1234567890000"
}

### Get some profile by id
GET http://localhost:3000/profile/cd53e3fb-44f4-4123-a35d-4c69bd2befb2

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "demo5",
    "password": "1234"
}

### Encode
POST http://localhost:3000/encode

### Decode
POST http://localhost:3000/decode